    <string name="pai_no_heart_rate">No heart rate from your watch yet. In Zepp, allow heart rate in Health Connect.</string>
    <string name="health_privacy_text">Pedometer reads steps, distance, active calories and heart rate from Health Connect so it can show the data your Amazfit watch (synced by the Zepp app) recorded, and estimate a weekly activity score.\n\nWatch data is only shown on this phone. If you turn on "Share steps with Google Health", Pedometer also writes the steps and distance this phone counts to Health Connect, where apps you allow, such as Google Health, can read them. Pedometer does not send your data anywhere else.\n\nThe activity score is an estimate made by this app from your heart rate. It is not Zepp\'s official PAI score and is not medical advice.</string>

